# Project: Цветы Любимого Города

Telegram Mini App for a flower delivery service in Каменск-Уральский.

## Stack
- **Monorepo**: pnpm workspaces + Turborepo
- **Backend** (`packages/api`): Fastify 5, Drizzle ORM, PostgreSQL 16, Redis 7
- **Frontend** (`packages/mini-app`): React 18, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS 4, `@telegram-apps/sdk-react`
- **Bot** (`packages/bot`): grammY ~1.39.3, Fastify (webhook + `/internal/notify`)
- **Shared** (`packages/shared`): Zod schemas, TS types, constants

## Brand & UI (design system)
- Primary: `#D64978`, Accent: `#F7BB53`, Surface: `#F8F9FA`, Font: **Montserrat** (`index.html` + `tokens.css`)
- Tokens: `packages/mini-app/src/design-system/tokens.css` — `@theme` (`brand-*`, `--shadow-card*`, `--border-brand-subtle`, `--radius-card`)
- Patterns aligned with landing-style polish: **hero** with layered blur orbs + gold title accent; **cards** with hover border + elevation; **bottom nav** with `nav-bottom-glass` (blur + brand top border); **page** shell uses `page-canvas`
- Russian-language UI; code comments in English

## Auth (API)
- Mini-app: `X-Init-Data` when Telegram provides signed `initData`; else `X-User-Id` (dev only outside production)
- Bot → API: `INTERNAL_API_SECRET` + `X-User-Id` (`tg-<id>` only)
- Catalog routes stay public; cart, orders, users require auth middleware

## API shape
- Success: `{ success: true, data: T }` — errors: `{ success: false, error: { code, message } }`

